  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swiss Anti-Trafficking Weeks 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at informing the general Swiss public and professionals that human trafficking also occurs in Switzerland and who to contact in case of suspicion. The topic will be addressed in different ways through events and activities organised by various partners throughout Switzerland. The series of events take place around the 18th October.</narrative>
  </description>
